1114
01:35:52.166 --> 01:35:53.458
Laura!

1115
01:35:55.000 --> 01:35:56.208
[groans]

1116
01:36:09.166 --> 01:36:11.041
[sobs] Mom!

1117
01:36:12.000 --> 01:36:13.166
[pants]

1118
01:36:13.250 --> 01:36:14.250
